cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use keygraph, please cite it as below."
title: "keygraph"
type: software
version: 0.3.3
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/alikarami76/keygraph"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alikarami76/keygraph"
authors:
  - family-names: Karami
    given-names: Ali
abstract: >-
  keygraph maps how the tables in a database connect: keys, indexes, declared and inferred
  foreign keys with confidence and evidence, business context and value profiles. It finds join
  paths between tables and gives people an offline HTML explorer and AI agents an MCP server,
  a CLI with JSON output and markdown files. It is read-only and deterministic.
keywords:
  - database
  - schema
  - foreign keys
  - join path
  - ER diagram
  - text-to-SQL
  - MCP
